       "plotText": {
        "plainText": "Silent weapon technology has grown from Operations Research (O.R.), a strategic and tactical methodology created under the Military Management in England during World War II. The original purpose of Operations Research was to study the strategic and tactical problems of air and land defense with the objective of effective use of limited military resources against foreign enemies (i.e., logistics). In this documentary, we learn the making and interviews of this happening."
